{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Slightly Mysterious 3D Puzzle Adventure on a Cool Summer Night</strong> <br><strong>You've pitched your tent\u2014but on this full moon night, something is bound to happen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a Tiny Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the valley where Buu has set foot, hidden mysteries emerge only on nights of the full moon.<br>The key to solving them? Engage with passersby, observe your surroundings, and take action!<br>Carry your lantern and dive into the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/2225d52c0406677551a3cf1f9f31d1c3.poster.avif?t=1768750391\" width=616 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/2225d52c0406677551a3cf1f9f31d1c3.webm?t=1768750391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unwind with a Cozy Campfire Coffee Break</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind the beans by turning the mill, boil water over a bonfire, and delicious coffee is ready.<br>You can also add milk or honey if you like! Serve drinks to people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/8b19319455f2cf7a673c344bf9a1bb81.poster.avif?t=1768750391\" width=616 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/8b19319455f2cf7a673c344bf9a1bb81.webm?t=1768750391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use your \u201cItems\u201d and \u201cSituations\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tent with a hole? Patch it up. A broken backpack ladder? Find materials to repair it.<br>Analyze the available tools and resources, and then utilize them effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/6c4b3f4ed4286da5378033f4c2d3b7d2.poster.avif?t=1768750391\" width=616 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/6c4b3f4ed4286da5378033f4c2d3b7d2.webm?t=1768750391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Worries\u2014This Is NOT a Horror Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night exploration games often bring to mind horror, but don't worry!<br>This game is completely horror-free. Shine a light into the darkness with your lantern and enjoy exploring the night in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/7fae9ee51a9e43569c38045d5a9222ad.poster.avif?t=1768750391\" width=616 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/7fae9ee51a9e43569c38045d5a9222ad.webm?t=1768750391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/9e98c80ece98092b48550c80a6df2ff2.webp?t=1768750391\" width=616 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Story's Worldview\ud83d\udcd6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on the world of &quot;Wokashi na Tatemono Tanbouki&quot;, a book written by the development team member Nonohara. It has been crafted as a completely original story.<br>You don\u2019t need to have read the book to enjoy the game, but reading it beforehand or after completing the game will make Buu\u2019s journey even more enjoyable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/extras/8c604760a99adc5eafed08fc7f494af8.avif?t=1768750391\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3260830?t=1768750391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/f4554e719696940f136d5c6aa5064049d96ee912/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768750391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/f3f387e8573ae8d94f274b512f0e4982137379bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768750391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260830/f3f387e8573ae8d94f274b512f0e4982137379bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768750391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Slightly Mysterious 3D Puzzle Adventure on a Cool Summer Night</strong> <br><strong>You've pitched your tent\u2014but on this full moon night, something is bound to happen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a Tiny Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the valley where Buu has set foot, hidden mysteries emerge only on nights of the full moon.<br>The key to solving them? Engage with passersby, observe your surroundings, and take action!<br>Carry your lantern and dive into the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><